    "summary": "Night 2026-10-06, software 2.4.0-rc3, spec ADS-WLC200-SRS v1.3, bench HIL-2: 12 runs, 9 passed, 3 failed. TC-AP-04 (R04) and TC-TH-03 (R10) have failed on all 10 nights in the history. TC-CAN-01 (R09) is a new failure tonight, after 9 passing nights.",
