        "text": "R04, Pinch detection when cold: stop_latency_ms was 14 ms against a limit of <= 10 ms. reversal_mm passed at 158.0 mm. Not new: it failed on 10 of 10 nights, under both v1.2 and v1.3, and the limit was <= 10 on every night. Values over the history ranged from 13.0 to 15.0 ms. Open defect DR-1001 (S1, Pinch reversal late at -30 °C). The run's temperature estimate at start was -22 C with the chamber set to -30 C."
