        "text": "R09, WLC_Status timing and content: period_max_ms was 112 ms against the v1.3 limit of 45 to 55 ms. period_min_ms passed at 49 ms. This is a new failure tonight. It passed on the 9 previous nights: 6 nights at 101 to 103 ms under the v1.2 limit of 90 to 110, and 3 nights at 51 to 52 ms under the v1.3 limit of 45 to 55. The log shows a 112 ms gap between t=6383 and t=6495 ms, and a frame was probably skipped. No open defect is linked."
